1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:04,160
(Sheldon:)Now that Leonard's made me aware
of how high the genetic stakes are...

2
00:00:04,330 --> 00:00:07,670
(Sheldon:)...we have to face the fact
that none of you are suitable for my sister.

3
00:00:07,834 --> 00:00:11,424
(Howard:)Wait a minute,
Leonard made you aware of that?

4
00:00:12,338 --> 00:00:14,798
(Leonard:)We all make mistakes. Let's move on.

5
00:00:15,133 --> 00:00:17,973
(Raj:)Excuse me, but I think you're missing
a big opportunity here.

6
00:00:18,136 --> 00:00:20,306
- How so?
- Everybody knows genetic diversity...

7
00:00:20,472 --> 00:00:22,302
(Raj:)...produces the strongest offspring.

8
00:00:22,474 --> 00:00:26,064
(Raj:)Why not put a little mocha
in the family latte?

9
00:00:28,646 --> 00:00:30,226
(Sheldon:)In principle, you have a point.

10
00:00:30,398 --> 00:00:34,358
(Sheldon:)But as a practical matter, need I remind you
it takes experimental pharmaceuticals...

11
00:00:34,527 --> 00:00:38,117
(Sheldon:)...to simply enable you
to speak to the opposite sex?

12
00:00:38,323 --> 00:00:42,033
I think you're focusing
entirely too much on the drugs.

13
00:00:47,373 --> 00:00:48,543
Is it because I'm Jewish?

14
00:00:48,708 --> 00:00:58,018
Because I'd kill my rabbi with a pork chop
to be with your sister.

